        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Friso, Alexander the Great\n- Topics: Frisian origin legends, medieval manuscripts, chronology\n\nFacts:\n- A manuscript written in a language spoken between the 8th and 16th centuries presents a Frisian origin legend.\n- In that manuscript, Friso is described as a leader of a group of Frisian colonists.\n- The manuscript says Alexander the Great discovered those Frisian colonists.\n- The manuscript claims the Frisian colonists had already been settled for well over a thousand years when Alexander the Great discovered them.",
